--- b7 medium.en: Now, what Plan G does not cover, the Part B deductible, which is $283 in 2026. Medigap plans sold to people who are new to Medicare on or after January 1, 2020, are not allowed to cover that deductible. That is why Plans C and F are closed to new people, and Plans D and G are the ones they can buy instead.
