--- b9 medium.en: What does it cost? You pay the private company a separate monthly premium for your Medigap policy, on top of the monthly Part B premium you pay to Medicare. In 2026, the standard Part B premium is $202.90. And the premium for the same plan letter can be very different from one company to another, so Medicare says to get quotes from more than one.
