--- b13 medium.en: Now Ben, he wants to leave Medicare Advantage and buy a Medigap plan. Medicare says it is illegal to sell a Medigap policy to someone in an Advantage plan, unless that person is switching back to original Medicare. And if Ben is not in his open enrollment period and has no guaranteed issue right, a company may deny him a policy or charge him more because of his health.
